summary.label:
This is a quick, simple and intuitive app for when you just don't have any dice available or for any situation that requires random number generation. Tap the screen to roll up. Use the app to play board games with friends and family. Its an excellent app suitable for a number of different board games without the worry or hassle of losing or misplacing your dice!

Subscription-related:
1、Users can use the ruler and protractor unlimited times only after the paid subscription;
2. The subscription fee will be deducted from the iTunes account when the user confirms the purchase and can be renewed automatically for $39.99/quarter;
3. users can turn off auto-renewal 24 hours before the end of the current subscription, otherwise the subscription will be automatically renewed;
4. the Apple ID of the automatically renewed subscription will be automatically deducted from the iTunes account 24 hours before the expiration of each billing cycle and the corresponding validity period will be extended;
5. Users manage the subscription service, i.e., they can go to their user accounts to set off automatic subscriptions after purchase.

